#==============================================================================================
#
#   fetching_3 - Fetch::Fetching: determining a request's environment and fetch response
#   handover
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Fetch/Fetching/Fetching.cpp (lines 727-930): determine the
#       environment, and fetch response handover ("fetch finale"): the report timing steps,
#       processResponse, processResponseEndOfBody (through an identity TransformStream when
#       the response has a body), and processResponseConsumeBody. Each C++ lambda is a
#       capture struct with a static function (DESIGN.md §2.7); the lambdas that share
#       `[&vm, &response, &fetch_params, timing_info]` share FetchFetchingFetchResponseHandover.
